---
description: Run a PathToShip production-readiness check before deploying, exposing a public URL, or handling real user data
alwaysApply: true
---
Before deploying this app, exposing a public URL, or handling real user data, run a PathToShip readiness check with the `pathtoship` MCP tools (`start_scan` → `get_findings` → fix → `verify_fix`) and resolve every critical finding. Never claim a finding is fixed without a `verify_fix` result. Set the `trigger` argument to `rules_file` when this rule is why you called the tool.
